#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:9
msgid "Solver Differences"
msgstr "求解器差异"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:11
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab presents a common asset and task interface across its physics "
"backends, but that interface does not make the underlying solver models "
"interchangeable. PhysX and the Newton solvers can use the same USD asset "
"while producing different trajectories because they construct contacts, "
"represent state, stabilize constraints, and allocate work differently."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 为不同物理后端提供统一的资源和任务接口，但这并不意味着底层求解器模型可以互换。PhysX 和 Newton 求解器即使使用相同的 "
"USD 资源，也可能产生不同轨迹，因为它们构建接触、表示状态、稳定约束和分配计算工作的方式不同。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:17
msgid ""
"The table below compares the documented PhysX and Newton MJWarp, Kamino, "
"VBD, and MPM workflows. The detailed sections focus on three solvers used "
"for rigid robots: PhysX, MuJoCo-Warp (MJWarp), and Kamino. For additional "
"Newton solver configurations, see :ref:`newton-backend`. OvPhysX is a "
"separate, experimental backend with its own limitations; it is not another "
"solver mode of the PhysX backend discussed here."
msgstr ""
"下表比较文档中介绍的 PhysX，以及 Newton 的 MJWarp、Kamino、VBD 和 MPM "
"工作流程。后续详细说明主要关注用于刚性机器人的三种求解器：PhysX、MuJoCo-Warp（MJWarp）和 Kamino。其他 Newton "
"求解器配置见 :ref:`newton-backend` 。OvPhysX 是独立的实验性后端，有自身的限制，并不是此处 PhysX "
"后端的另一种求解器模式。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use this page to understand the model differences. For the controls and a "
"measured tuning procedure, use :doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_mjwarp` or"
" :doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino`; the generated solver "
"configuration APIs are the reference for exact fields and defaults."
msgstr ""
"本页用于理解模型差异。具体参数和基于测量的调参方法见 :doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_mjwarp` 或 "
":doc:`/source/how-to/solver_tuning_kamino` ；准确字段与默认值以生成的求解器配置 API 为准。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:29
msgid ""
"For finer-grained comparisons of features, contact materials, and joint "
"support among Newton solvers, see the `Newton supported-features matrix "
"<https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/solvers/index.html#supported-features>`__."
msgstr ""
"Newton 求解器之间更细致的功能、接触材质和关节支持比较，见 `Newton 功能支持矩阵 <https://newton-"
"physics.github.io/newton/stable/solvers/index.html#supported-features>`__ 。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:33
msgid ""
"For checkpoint compatibility and articulation ordering, follow "
":doc:`/source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton`. Its "
":ref:`side-by-side transfer demonstrations <sim-to-sim-transfer-"
"demonstrations>` show PhysX-trained policies running in Newton MJWarp."
msgstr ""
"检查点兼容性和关节体顺序见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` 。其中的 :ref:`并排迁移演示 <sim-to-"
"sim-transfer-demonstrations>` 展示了在 Newton MJWarp 中运行 PhysX 训练策略的效果。"

