#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:124
msgid ""
"PhysX surface and volume deformables use an experimental asset API, require "
"CUDA, and need ``scene.replicate_physics=False``. Nodal kinematic targets "
"are supported for volume deformables only. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/deformables` and "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.DeformableObject` for the asset requirements."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 表面与体积可变形体使用实验性资源 API，需要 CUDA，并要求 ``scene.replicate_physics=False`` "
"。节点运动学目标仅支持体积可变形体。资源要求见 :doc:`/source/concepts/deformables` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.assets.DeformableObject` 。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:129
msgid ""
"VBD's limited joint support does not replace a general robot articulation. "
"The maintained Franka deformable tasks assign the robot to MJWarp and the "
"deformable to VBD through proxy coupling. MPM advances particle materials; "
"dynamic rigid bodies need a separate rigid solver. See "
":doc:`/source/concepts/coupled_solvers` and "
":doc:`/source/concepts/using_mpm` for the supported scene construction and "
"coupling limitations."
msgstr ""
"VBD 对关节的有限支持不能替代通用机器人关节体。维护中的 Franka 可变形体任务通过代理耦合，让 MJWarp 处理机器人、VBD "
"处理可变形体。MPM 推进粒子材料，动态刚体需要单独的刚体求解器。受支持的场景构建方式和耦合限制见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/coupled_solvers` 和 :doc:`/source/concepts/using_mpm` "
"。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:137
msgid "Why solver settings do not translate directly"
msgstr "为什么不能直接迁移求解器设置"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:139
msgid ""
"A configuration value has meaning only within the solver that consumes it. "
"For example, PhysX scene controls do not configure a Newton solver, and "
"MJWarp's MuJoCo-specific controls do not configure PhysX. The common Isaac "
"Lab configuration selects a backend and solver; it does not translate a "
"numerical setting into an equivalent physical effect."
msgstr ""
"配置值只有在使用它的求解器中才具有确定含义。例如，PhysX 场景参数不能配置 Newton 求解器，MJWarp 的 MuJoCo 专用参数也不能配置"
" PhysX。Isaac Lab 的统一配置负责选择后端与求解器，不会将某个数值设置换算成等效的物理作用。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:145
msgid ""
"Even settings with similar names can participate in different contact models"
" or convergence criteria. Porting therefore starts by preserving the "
"mechanical model, collision geometry, material bindings, reset state, "
"actuator behavior, and control period. Then compare the resulting physical "
"behavior and tune the target solver with its own controls."
msgstr ""
"即使名称相似，设置也可能作用于不同的接触模型或收敛条件。因此，迁移应先保留机械模型、碰撞几何、材质绑定、重置状态、执行器行为和控制周期，再比较实际物理行为，使用目标求解器自己的参数进行调节。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:152
msgid "Friction and contact"
msgstr "摩擦与接触"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:154
msgid ""
"PhysX uses patch-based Coulomb friction: nearby contacts can be correlated "
"into a friction patch. Its friction-correlation and offset controls are part"
" of :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg`. MJWarp uses MuJoCo's contact "
"model, including its selectable pyramidal or elliptic friction cone and "
"frictional impedance ratio. Kamino resolves hard frictional contacts in its "
"maximal-coordinate constrained dynamics solve and exposes contact-material "
"mixing and warm-start configuration through its generated API."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 使用基于接触片的库仑摩擦，相邻接触可以关联成一个摩擦接触片。摩擦关联和偏移参数属于 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 。MJWarp 使用 MuJoCo "
"的接触模型，包括可选的多面体或椭圆摩擦锥，以及摩擦阻抗比。Kamino 在最大坐标约束动力学求解中处理硬摩擦接触，并通过生成的 API "
"提供接触材质混合和热启动配置。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:162
msgid ""
"The collision path also differs. PhysX exposes continuous collision "
"detection through :attr:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg.enable_ccd`, but "
"Isaac Lab disables that option when GPU dynamics is enabled. MJWarp can use "
"either its internal MuJoCo contact path or Newton's collision pipeline; "
"those modes are mutually exclusive. Kamino can use Newton's collision "
"pipeline or, when enabled, its own internal collision detector. These "
"choices determine which capacity and collision controls are active."
msgstr ""
"碰撞处理路径也不同。PhysX 通过 :attr:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg.enable_ccd` "
"提供连续碰撞检测，但启用 GPU 动力学时，Isaac Lab 会禁用这一选项。MJWarp 可使用内部 MuJoCo 接触路径或 Newton "
"碰撞流程，两者互斥。Kamino 可使用 Newton 碰撞流程，也可在启用后使用其内部碰撞检测器。这些选择决定哪些容量和碰撞参数生效。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:170
msgid ""
"**Porting implication.** Equal material coefficients do not guarantee equal "
"slip, grasp stability, or contact counts. Revalidate collision geometry and "
"contact behavior before tuning friction. A task that depended on PhysX CCD "
"needs an independently validated timestep and collision strategy on Newton; "
"MJWarp's ``ccd_iterations`` is a convex GJK/EPA convergence limit, not a "
"PhysX-style CCD switch."
msgstr ""
"**对迁移的影响。** 相同材质系数不能保证相同的滑移、抓取稳定性或接触数量。调节摩擦前，应重新验证碰撞几何和接触行为。依赖 PhysX CCD "
"的任务迁移到 Newton 后，需要独立验证时间步长和碰撞策略；MJWarp 的 ``ccd_iterations`` 是凸 GJK/EPA "
"算法的收敛迭代上限，并不是 PhysX 式的 CCD 开关。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:178
msgid "Restitution and stabilization"
msgstr "恢复系数与稳定化"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:180
msgid ""
"PhysX applies restitution using per-material properties and a scene-level "
"bounce threshold. Its optional stabilization pass can improve large-timestep"
" behavior, but can make reported contact-sensor forces inaccurate. MJWarp "
"expresses contact compliance through its MuJoCo model and solver "
"formulation; Kamino exposes Baumgarte stabilization separately for bilateral"
" joints, unilateral joint limits, and unilateral contacts."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 根据材质属性和场景级反弹阈值应用恢复系数。可选的稳定化处理能够改善大时间步长下的行为，但可能使接触传感器报告的力不准确。MJWarp 通过 "
"MuJoCo 模型和求解器形式描述接触柔顺性；Kamino 则分别为双边关节约束、单边关节限位和单边接触提供 Baumgarte 稳定化。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:187
msgid ""
"These are different mechanisms, so copying a restitution or stabilization "
"setting does not preserve resting-contact behavior. The exact configuration "
"surface belongs in the :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg`, "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MJWarpSolverCfg`, and "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoConstraintsCfg` API references."
msgstr ""
"这些机制不同，因此复制恢复系数或稳定化设置，不能保证静止接触行为一致。准确的配置参数见 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 、 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MJWarpSolverCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoConstraintsCfg` API 文档。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:193
msgid ""
"**Porting implication.** Validate bounce, penetration, chatter, and measured"
" contact forces in the target solver. Do not use a stabilization or "
"restitution control as a substitute for valid collision geometry, reset "
"state, or material properties."
msgstr ""
"**对迁移的影响。** 在目标求解器中验证反弹、穿透、抖振和测得的接触力。不要通过稳定化或恢复系数参数，弥补无效的碰撞几何、重置状态或材质属性。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:199
msgid "Coordinates and state consistency"
msgstr "坐标与状态一致性"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:201
msgid ""
"PhysX articulations and MJWarp use reduced joint coordinates for their "
"articulated state. Kamino solves rigid multi-body systems in maximal "
"coordinates with constraints. Its reset path can reconcile body poses with "
"reduced joint state through forward kinematics; whether that path is used is"
" determined by "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg.use_fk_solver` and the "
"articulation structure."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 关节体和 MJWarp 使用简约关节坐标表示关节系统状态。Kamino "
"使用最大坐标和约束求解刚性多体系统，其重置流程可通过正向运动学使刚体位姿与简约关节状态保持一致。是否使用这一流程，取决于 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg.use_fk_solver` 和关节体结构。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:208
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab asset APIs maintain the public state interface across the "
"backends, but custom reset code can still write a state that is inconsistent"
" with the target solver's representation."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 资源 API 在各后端之间维持统一的公共状态接口，但自定义重置代码仍可能写入与目标求解器状态表示不一致的状态。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:212
msgid ""
"**Porting implication.** Use the asset write APIs for resets and validate "
"the first step with a fixed state. For Kamino, treat disagreement between "
"joint state and body poses as a reset-modeling problem before tuning solver "
"gains."
msgstr ""
"**对迁移的影响。** 使用资源写入 API 进行重置，并用固定状态验证首次步进。对于 "
"Kamino，应先将关节状态与刚体位姿的不一致视为重置建模问题，再考虑调节求解器增益。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:217
msgid "Timesteps and convergence"
msgstr "时间步长与收敛"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:219
msgid ""
"PhysX advances at the simulation timestep and uses actor iteration counts "
"within scene limits. MJWarp and Kamino each run "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.num_substeps` solver substeps per "
"physics tick, so their solver timestep is the simulation timestep divided by"
" the substep count. More substeps change integration work; they do not "
"translate a PhysX iteration setting into a Newton equivalent."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 按仿真时间步长推进，在场景限制范围内使用各对象的迭代次数。MJWarp 和 Kamino 在每个物理步中均运行 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.num_substeps` "
"个求解器子步，因此求解器时间步长等于仿真时间步长除以子步数。增加子步会改变积分工作量，不能将 PhysX 的迭代设置直接换算成 Newton "
"中的等效设置。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:226
msgid ""
"Substeps do not inherently refresh Newton-pipeline contacts. When that "
"pipeline is active, "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.collision_decimation` can re-"
"collide within a physics tick only when it is positive and less than "
"``num_substeps``; the default value of zero collides once at the start of "
"each tick. This setting does not apply when MJWarp uses its internal MuJoCo "
"contact path or Kamino uses its internal collision detector."
msgstr ""
"子步本身不会刷新 Newton 碰撞流程的接触。当使用该流程时，只有 "
":attr:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg.collision_decimation` 为正且小于 "
"``num_substeps`` ，才会在一个物理步中重新进行碰撞检测；默认值为零，表示仅在每个物理步开始时检测一次。MJWarp 使用内部 "
"MuJoCo 接触路径，或 Kamino 使用内部碰撞检测器时，此设置不生效。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:233
msgid ""
"MJWarp provides outer iterations, line-search iterations, and a residual "
"tolerance. Kamino's P-ADMM and DVI modes have different iteration and "
"convergence controls. PhysX has its own position and velocity iteration "
"model. Consult the generated APIs and the focused tuning guides for current "
"controls instead of copying another solver's defaults."
msgstr ""
"MJWarp 提供外层迭代次数、线搜索迭代次数和残差容差。Kamino 的 P-ADMM 与 DVI 模式有不同的迭代和收敛参数。PhysX "
"则有自身的位置与速度迭代模型。应查阅生成的 API 和专门的调参指南，了解当前参数，而不是复制另一种求解器的默认值。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:239
msgid ""
"**Porting implication.** Compare a fixed reproduction at the intended policy"
" period, then separately test timestep, substeps, and solver convergence. An"
" iteration increase cannot correct invalid contact geometry, incompatible "
"reset state, or an unstable controller."
msgstr ""
"**对迁移的影响。** "
"在预期策略控制周期下比较一个固定的复现案例，再分别测试时间步长、子步数和求解器收敛。增加迭代次数不能修复无效接触几何、不兼容的重置状态或不稳定的控制器。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:245
msgid "Capacity and memory"
msgstr "容量与内存"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:247
msgid ""
"PhysX allocates GPU buffers for scene limits, including rigid-contact "
"capacity. MJWarp has per-world contact and constraint limits such as "
"``nconmax`` and ``njmax``. Kamino has per-world contact allocation controls "
"in addition to the capacity used by its selected collision path. Their units"
" and failure modes are solver-specific, even when every environment contains"
" the same asset."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 根据场景上限分配 GPU 缓冲区，包括刚体接触容量。MJWarp 有 ``nconmax`` 、 ``njmax`` "
"等每个仿真世界的接触和约束上限。Kamino "
"除所选碰撞路径使用的容量外，也有每个仿真世界的接触分配参数。即使每个环境包含相同资源，这些参数的单位和失败方式仍各不相同。"

#: source/concepts/solver_differences.rst:253
msgid ""
"**Porting implication.** Measure the target solver's busiest reset and "
"contact states before scaling environment count. Increase an observed "
"overflowing capacity first; capacity changes cannot repair an invalid "
"contact model or convergence problem."
msgstr ""
"**对迁移的影响。** "
"扩大环境数量前，先测量目标求解器在重置和接触最密集状态下的需求。优先增大已观测到溢出的容量；容量调整不能修复无效的接触模型或收敛问题。"
